_build/
*.c
*.ll
*.wat
*.wasm
mbrowse

# Python's caches, from the maintenance scripts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The fetch gate's corpus is GENERATED, deterministically, by scripts/fetch_server.py on every run —
# the same reason the reftests commit no expected images: both sides are made at gate time, so there
# is nothing to keep in step. 200 KB of it is a synthetic byte pattern from a one-line function.
#
# `test/data/northstar/` is the opposite and is committed: a snapshot of a real page whose whole
# purpose is that the bytes do NOT change, with its URL, date and digest beside it.
test/data/fetch/
